1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,844
Factory band ho gayi, Kamla. Ab ghar kaise chalega?

2
00:00:04,144 --> 00:00:09,658
Arre, tumhari banayi anda bhurji to sab ungliyan chaat ke khaate hain. Thela lagao!

3
00:00:09,958 --> 00:00:12,512
Ande ka thela? Log raat mein aayenge?

4
00:00:12,812 --> 00:00:16,769
Thela, tawa, gas aur ande ki tray. 25 hazaar kaafi hai.

5
00:00:17,069 --> 00:00:23,497
Shaam 6 se raat 12 baje tak, hostel ya market ke paas. Raat ki bhookh sabse badi hoti hai!

6
00:00:24,047 --> 00:00:27,733
Uncle, double anda bhurji, extra butter! Exam ki raat hai!

7
00:00:28,033 --> 00:00:31,500
Ye lo, garma garam bhurji pav. 60 rupaye plate!

8
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:35,742
Roz 80-100 plate, yaani raat ke 2 hazaar ki bachat.

9
00:00:36,042 --> 00:00:40,842
Omelette, boiled anda aur anda curry bhi rakho. Aur Zomato pe bhi daalo.

10
00:00:41,142 --> 00:00:45,198
Sunday ho ya Monday, roz khao ande! Shambhu ki life set!
